.TH HOPASH-PROFILE-USE 1 2026-08-01 "Hopash RS 0.1.1" "Hopash RS User Commands"
.SH NAME
hopash\-profile\-use \- Activate a validated Profile Snapshot
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBhopash profile use\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIPROFILE\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Activate a validated Profile Snapshot
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit a versioned JSON document or NDJSON stream
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIPROFILE\fR>
Opaque Profile ID or unique case\-sensitive display name
